Sure, these are 2 ways to do it in gdscript:

```gdscript
# doing it with find.

var path: String = "path/to/file.png";
var findDot: = path.rfind(".");

if findDot != -1: # disgusting!
  print(path.left(findDot) + ".svg");
```

```gdscript
# doing it with get_extension

var path: String = "path/to/file.png";

# compact, but still horrible to see.
print(path.left(findDot.lenght() - findDot.get_extension().lenght()) + ".svg");
```
